    ('---\nname: aetherwave-video-generation\nversion: 2.0.0\nplatform: AetherWave Studio\nskill_url: https://aetherwavestudio.com/skills/video-generation.skill\napi_docs: https://aetherwavestudio.com/developers\nbadge: Agent Ready\nmotto: All intelligence welcome here.\n---\n\n# AetherWave — Video Generation\n\nGenerate AI video clips from text prompts or images. Supports Kling, Hailuo, Luma, Seedance, and more through a single API.\n\n---\n\n## Authentication\n\n```\nX-AW-Key: your_api_key_here\n```\n\nGet a key: Sign up at **https://aetherwavestudio.com** → Profile → Developer tab → Generate API Key\n\n---\n\n## Available Models\n\n| Key | Provider | Best For | Duration |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `kling-2.1-t2v` | Kling 2.1 | General T2V, good motion | 5-10s |\n| `kling-2.6-t2v` | Kling 2.6 | High quality T2V | 5-10s |\n| `hailuo-t2v` | Hailuo MiniMax | Cinematic, character motion | 5s |\n| `luma-ray2-t2v` | Luma Ray 2 | Photorealistic | 5s |\n| `seedance-1.0-t2v` | Seedance | Dance/motion transfer | 5s |\n| `wan-t2v` | Wan | Anime, stylized | 5s |\n| `pixverse-v4-t2v` | Pixverse V4 | Fast, stylized | 5s |\n\n---\n\n## Core Endpoints\n\n### Generate Video (async)\n```\nPOST https://aetherwavestudio.com/api/generate-video\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  "prompt": "Cinematic drone shot over a neon-lit cyberpunk city at night, rain, reflections",\n  "model": "kling-2.1-t2v",\n  "aspectRatio": "16:9",\n  "duration": 5\n}\n```\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  "taskId": "vid_abc123",\n  "message": "Video generation started",\n  "creditsUsed": 35,\n  "model": "kling-2.1-t2v"\n}\n```\n\n### Poll Status\n```\nGET https://aetherwavestudio.com/api/generate-video/status/{taskId}\n```\n\n**Response (complete):**\n```json\n{\n  "taskId": "vid_abc123",\n  "status": "complete",\n  "videoUrl": "https://cdn-url.com/video.mp4",\n  "thumbnailUrl": "https://cdn-url.com/thumb.jpg"\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Parameters\n\n| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `prompt` | string | Yes | Text description of the video |\n| `model` | string | Yes | Model key from the table above |\n| `aspectRatio` | string | No | `"16:9"`, `"9:16"`, `"1:1"`. Default: `"16:9"` |\n| `duration` | number | No | Duration in seconds (5 or 10). Default: `5` |\n| `imageData` | string | No | Base64 image for image-to-video (I2V) |\n| `quality` | string | No | `"standard"` or `"high"`. Default: `"standard"` |\n\n---\n\n## Agent Pattern\n\n```python\nimport requests, time\n\nheaders = {"X-AW-Key": "aw_live_...", "Content-Type": "application/json"}\nbase = "https://aetherwavestudio.com"\n\n# 1. Generate\nresult = requests.post(f"{base}/api/generate-video", headers=headers, json={\n    "prompt": "Slow zoom into a glowing crystal cave, purple light, particles floating",\n    "model": "kling-2.1-t2v",\n    "aspectRatio": "16:9",\n    "duration": 5\n}).json()\n\ntask_id = result["taskId"]\n\n# 2. Poll (video takes 1-5 minutes)\nwhile True:\n    status = requests.get(f"{base}/api/generate-video/status/{task_id}", headers=headers).json()\n    if status.get("status") == "complete":\n        print(status["videoUrl"])\n        break\n    elif status.get("status") == "failed":\n        print("Generation failed")\n        break\n    time.sleep(10)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Notes for LLMs\n\n- Video generation is **async** and takes 1-5 minutes depending on model\n- Poll every 10 seconds (not faster — generation is slow)\n- For image-to-video, send `imageData` as base64-encoded image\n- `kling-2.1-t2v` is the best default for general use\n- `hailuo-t2v` is best for cinematic/character shots\n- Duration options: most models support 5s, some support 10s\n- Video URLs are temporary — download promptly\n\n---\n\n*AetherWave Studio — All intelligence welcome here.*\n*https://aetherwavestudio.com/developers*\n', False),
